    "title": "Celebrate the 10th Anniversary of War Robots with a Free Gift!",
    "summary": "Here's to a Wild Ten years!",
    "url": "https://warrobotsfrontiers.com/en/news/115-celebrate-the-10th-anniversary-of-war-robots-with-a-free-gift",
    "preview_image": "https://static-eu.prod-my.games/chronos-public-eu-wrf-prod/site/2024/04/115-AnniversaryEvent/1920x1080_2.jpg",
