    "content": "<p>In honor of the 10th anniversary of the War Robots universe, you can grab the exclusive <strong>Decennial Legacy Robot Skin</strong> for <strong>free</strong>. Get yours before <strong>May 2 </strong>by simply logging in and playing War Robots: Frontiers.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media2.giphy.com/media/P09XeRKcW9LGOabbOf/giphy.gif\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<h2>PLAY FOR FREE UNTIL MAY 2</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>If you&rsquo;ve not experienced the Wild Ten yet, you can try out the <a href=\"https://wrfrontiers.com/news/108\">Spring update</a> and the full War Robots: Frontiers Early Access experience <strong>for free now until May 2</strong> via <a href=\"https://warrobotsfrontiers.com/download\">MY.GAMES Launcher</a> or the free Demo Version on <a href=\"https://store.steampowered.com/app/1491000/War_Robots_Frontiers/\">Steam</a>.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>JOIN THE WAR ROBOTS COMMUNITY!</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Subscribe to the <a href=\"https://wrfrontiers.com/subscribe\">official newsletter</a> to get more of the latest news like this straight to your inbox, follow the game on <a href=\"https://twitter.com/WRFrontiers\">Twitter</a> and <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/wrfrontiers\">Facebook</a>, and join the <a href=\"https://wr.app/FrontiersDiscord\">official Discord server</a>. You can also wishlist and follow War Robots: Frontiers on <a href=\"https://store.steampowered.com/app/1491000\">Steam</a> to get the latest news there.</p>",
